cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research, please cite the repository and its current manuscript."
authors:
  - family-names: "Afreen H"
    given-names: "Shaik Jouzia"
title: "Effects of Appended Distractor Context on RAG Answer Quality and Generation Latency"
abstract: >-
  Exploratory evaluation of answer-quality metrics and generation-call latency
  when distractor chunks are appended after an already retrieved top-five
  context in BM25, dense, and hybrid retrieval pipelines. This is not a
  retrieval-ranking robustness evaluation.
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - appended context
  - distractor noise
  - answer quality
  - generation latency
url: "https://github.com/jouzia/rag-retrieval-robustness"
